{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an unbelievably boring and simple game I made, but it\u2019s all I can do. Enjoy~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep clicking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warm Narration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each failed attempt is rewarded with a random speech. Don\u2019t hate me for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Secret Thing?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game only asks for one action, but you\u2019ll probably overthink it anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endgame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you\u2019ve played enough, you should stop. Seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You Should Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You love boring things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally! This is our first game on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We decided to publish a game after learning a few things about game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re already working on learning more and developing our next game\u2014stay tuned!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Close","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3517600/5fcebfc125d39df9ebe1539cbc1ed41b3f8ed629.jpg"},{"name":"Persistent Clicker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3517600/dc105a075eeb9d52996353dad5735984a142634a.jpg"},{"name":"Speech Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3517600/363262be9bfef65ec0b29795b015d279f79c61e8.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3517600/b848353949fe22e8279570b198c59d5f3b3a2dc2.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Closes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3517600/1211d606031e2aa629b8927404983ae9d441f009